  "contract": [
    "GNUstep alone draws controls and supplies native readback dimensions.",
    "A snapshot is keyed by its configured layout viewport, not by a separately rounded paint size.",
    "Gecko alone maps the complete native image into its destination using its original DrawSurface transform, sampling and clipping.",
